Z||000012||CoolBlue87GT||06-03-2001||08:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroJoe:<BR><B>No, that's a different dave.  read the 3rd and 4th posts to this topic.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR> <A HREF="http://wtv-zone.com/fierodave/" TARGET=_blank>http://wtv-zone.com/fierodave/</A> <P>Looking at his web site, are you sure ?<P>The following is from his site ;<P> Fieros Are Hotter Than Ever!  <P>Collector value is rising! This website is based on the preservation of the stock Fiero and it's restoration. This site will be concentrating on the stock aspect of the Fiero because there are many other sites on the web that specialize on performance upgrades. See below for pictures and biography of this time capsule and other new and old projects in the works! This website has many pictures of Fieros from fastbacks to the Kit Car conversions. Stop by often and see what new Fieros I have on display and for sale! <P> <P>1986 GT Fiero GT ........<BR>Fastback............,,,,...<BR> My name is David Andregg, and I live in Mosinee, WI . I had this website built because of the problems I had restoring my first Fiero I bought two years ago. It needed many things repaired. The regular outlets either didn't have the parts needed, or the parts were very expensive. I was really tired of it, so I did hours of searching and investigating, and here are some things I hope will help you out. <P><BR>......My Newest Addition!<BR>............1985 Fiero GT<BR>.......13K Original Miles <BR> I've owned over 100 Fieros since then, and I'm always buying and selling Fiero cars and parts. This site was designed to be fun and informative, and has become a popular site for both Fiero owners and those interested in Fieros. Check out the great photos of Fieros on this site, what's for sale, and what I'm currently in search of. But most of all, have fun with your Fiero! Please reload each page if you've visited this site before due to this site's enormous daily updates! <BR> <BR>THE TEXT ON THIS SITE   InLive!   <BR> 2 visitors currently on the site  <P>Click below to browse Fiero Classified Ads or place a free ad to buy, sell, or trade Fiero cars or parts in "Fierodave's Classifieds"  <BR> FIERODAVE'S CLASSIFIEDS<P>||||reg||1
